{"4431390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ColdShift Derby", "steam_appid": 4431390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ColdShift Derby</strong> is a fast‑paced, vehicle‑combat survival game set in a frozen post‑apocalyptic wasteland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/a49d08f56e833614827c753be61bdda9.poster.avif?t=1782445450\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/a49d08f56e833614827c753be61bdda9.webm?t=1782445450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/a49d08f56e833614827c753be61bdda9.mp4?t=1782445450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drive a lone rig across the tundra, battling waves of raiders and scavenging supplies as you fight to stay alive long enough to reach the last warm refuge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The tundra is a battleground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy convoys swarm the ice, fuel is scarce, and every run pushes your vehicle closer to its limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/e36459f576e81e5951ca254c4c7bd5ac.poster.avif?t=1782445450\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/e36459f576e81e5951ca254c4c7bd5ac.webm?t=1782445450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/e36459f576e81e5951ca254c4c7bd5ac.mp4?t=1782445450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your rig, bolt on new weapons, and unleash explosive demolition‑derby combat inspired by action‑heavy arena survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive as long as you can</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with each run and push deeper into hostile territory on your drive toward the final safe haven.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast, explosive vehicular combat with wave‑based enemy swarms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Impactful upgrades for weapons, armor, engines, and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Resource‑driven survival where fuel and scrap determine your power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Endless‑style runs across a frozen wasteland filled with raiders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A progression path leading toward the last warm refuge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold is relentless. The road is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your engine and fight your way through the frost!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ColdShift Derby</strong> is a fast‑paced, vehicle‑combat survival game set in a frozen post‑apocalyptic wasteland. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/a49d08f56e833614827c753be61bdda9.poster.avif?t=1782445450\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/a49d08f56e833614827c753be61bdda9.webm?t=1782445450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/a49d08f56e833614827c753be61bdda9.mp4?t=1782445450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drive a lone rig across the tundra, battling waves of raiders and scavenging supplies as you fight to stay alive long enough to reach the last warm refuge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The tundra is a battleground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy convoys swarm the ice, fuel is scarce, and every run pushes your vehicle closer to its limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/e36459f576e81e5951ca254c4c7bd5ac.poster.avif?t=1782445450\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/e36459f576e81e5951ca254c4c7bd5ac.webm?t=1782445450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431390/extras/e36459f576e81e5951ca254c4c7bd5ac.mp4?t=1782445450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your rig, bolt on new weapons, and unleash explosive demolition‑derby combat inspired by action‑heavy arena survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive as long as you can</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with each run and push deeper into hostile territory on your drive toward the final safe haven.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast, explosive vehicular combat with wave‑based enemy swarms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Impactful upgrades for weapons, armor, engines, and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Resource‑driven survival where fuel and scrap determine your power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Endless‑style runs across a frozen wasteland filled with raiders</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A progression path leading toward the last warm refuge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold is relentless. The road is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your engine and fight your way through the frost!</p>", "short_description": "A fast‑paced vehicl